			"type": "detail",
			"title": "Credential",
			"_note": "A Credential is an issued certificate/badge (learner, course, kind, issued/expires, issuer DID, signature, OpenBadges3 + EDCI payloads, verification URL, revocation reason) — the education document/attestation archetype. Body leads with issuance metadata 8-wide + a Related panel resolving learner + course + issuing enrolment. The signed badge artefacts render as a Files leaf (a credential IS a downloadable/verifiable document). No email/calendar: a credential is a sealed award, not correspondence (HARD RULE 1). Sidebar keeps metadata + audit-trail — issuance and revocation events are the credential's legal record.",
			"config": {
				"register": "learniq",
				"schema": "Credential",
				"lifecycleActions": {
