			"type": "detail",
			"title": "Verify Credential",
			"_note": "Public verification view of a Credential (mode:public) — a third party checking authenticity, NOT an internal editor. Deliberately minimal: a single full-width Data block showing only the verifiable claims (kind, learner, course, issued/expires, issuer DID, revocation status) plus a Files leaf for the signed badge artefact. No related-index, no comms, no audit sidebar — a public verifier must see the assertion and its signature and nothing about internal relations or history (HARD RULE 1, minimal-surface). Sidebar disabled: this is an anonymous proof page.",
			"config": {
